# Demons Must Fall

## Scratchpad

Task: Replace the placeholder README-only repo with a playable first-version scaffold for an indie action/combat game named Demons Must Fall. Open a PR into main.

Stack: TypeScript + Phaser 4.2 + Vite. 2D arena combat, web-first, desktop later via Tauri/Electron.

Plan:
